  "releaseNotes": "--- 0.1.0 ---\n[Improvements]\nAdded explicit TargetFrameworks for net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0 to supplement netstandard2.0. \nUpdated dependencies to latest versions.\n\n[Fixes]\nFixed Logger.Log accepting a LogLevel parameter but hardcoding LogLevel.Critical when constructing LoggerMessageEventArgs, causing every call to emit a Critical-level event regardless of the specified level.\n\n--- 0.0.0 ---\n[New]\nInitial release of OwlCore.Diagnostics.",
